            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "So the reason was that built-in quickfix filetype [is setting its own 'statusline' value](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/f01f18cdf4ffc3ce035db5fde2f45493eebb7fd9/runtime/ftplugin/qf.vim#L13-L18) *after* 'mini.statusline' sets its own. This should be fixed in latest ` main`.",
